# Local development secrets for the Cloudflare Worker.
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (untracked) and fill in real values.
#
# `.dev.vars` is loaded automatically by `wrangler`/`vite dev` for local development.
# No variables are required for the current health-check-only foundation; this file
# exists so future phases (Groq, RAG, LiveAvatar) have a documented place to add secrets.

# GROQ_API_KEY=
# LIVEAVATAR_API_KEY=
# LIVEAVATAR_AVATAR_ID=
